The narrow changes prevent automatic replay of uncertain OT mutations, provide
an explicit prepare build hook, and accept a bounded inherited session descriptor
without a worker cookie file or browser fallback. The native protocol remains
upstream code. Exact corresponding source, including its build instructions,
package lock and notices, is in upstream-source.tar.gz; upstream-pin.json records
the revision and source archive SHA-256. Keep these with redistributed resources.
Dependency licenses/notices remain in their node_modules package directories.
